WEBVTT

00:01.330 --> 00:02.670
<b>HMPH!</b>

00:02.670 --> 00:06.920
<b>Only 7 days, 13 hours and
23 minutes until Valentine's Day.</b>

00:07.040 --> 00:08.750
<b>What are we gonna do this year?</b>

00:08.750 --> 00:10.460
<b>Oh, you're right!</b>

00:10.460 --> 00:12.920
<b>We should put together some sorta plan.</b>

00:12.920 --> 00:15.830
<b>We gotta be real nice to the younger girls, yeah?</b>

00:15.830 --> 00:17.880
<b>And make it obvious we like sweet stuff, right?</b>

00:17.880 --> 00:21.000
<b>Then we gotta make sure we walk
the halls near their classes day-of.</b>

00:21.000 --> 00:23.250
<b>That's a plan to GET chocolates!</b>

00:24.750 --> 00:26.630
<b>Valentine's Day...</b>

00:26.920 --> 00:28.540
<b>Never been interested.</b>

00:28.540 --> 00:31.920
<b>Hey, why don't we all make some
we can dish out to the boys?</b>

00:31.920 --> 00:33.920
<b>Really? Sounds like work...
</b><b>Oh! That sounds fun!</b><b></b>

00:35.000 --> 00:39.540
<b>Won't be a single boy who says no if we
tell them Anna helped us make 'em.</b>

00:39.540 --> 00:41.250
<b>Right, Icchi?</b>

00:41.250 --> 00:41.880
<b>Wha...?</b>

00:42.080 --> 00:43.920
<b>Hey, hang on now!</b>

00:43.920 --> 00:47.670
<b>Wouldn't that count as me giving them all chocolates?</b>

00:47.670 --> 00:48.920
<b>Wanna call it off, then?</b>

00:50.380 --> 00:55.380
<b>I've always wanted you to show me how
to make snacks and stuff though...</b>

00:55.380 --> 00:58.040
<b>And chocolate is the king of snacks!</b>

00:58.040 --> 01:02.330
<b>All the more reason for us to do a little chocolate run.</b>

01:02.330 --> 01:03.580
<b>Meet at my place?</b>

01:03.580 --> 01:04.290
<b>Huh?</b>

01:04.670 --> 01:06.080
<b>Wait... umm...</b>

01:06.380 --> 01:07.420
<b>Let's do it at mine.</b>

01:07.420 --> 01:08.960
<b>Wait, really?</b>

01:08.960 --> 01:10.000
<b>Yeah.</b>

01:10.380 --> 01:11.330
<b>Okay?</b>

01:13.460 --> 01:16.460
<b>What? Why am I part of this?</b>

02:51.040 --> 02:52.710
<b>Back again...</b>

02:53.080 --> 02:56.420
<b>Why invite me to this, though?</b>

02:56.420 --> 02:58.460
<b>They're making chocolate for all the guys.</b>

02:58.460 --> 03:00.750
<b>Huh? Oh, Ichikawa!</b>

03:01.080 --> 03:02.790
<b>H-hey...</b>

03:03.040 --> 03:05.960
<b>What are the odds?
What are you doing 'round here?</b>

03:05.960 --> 03:06.580
<b>Huh?</b>

03:06.580 --> 03:07.630
<b>What...?</b>

03:08.330 --> 03:11.630
<b>We're headed to Yamada's place
to make some chocolate goodies.</b>

03:12.540 --> 03:13.960
<b>I'm just passing by...</b>

03:16.420 --> 03:19.040
<b>Wait, what's going on?</b>

03:19.040 --> 03:21.880
<b>Was I not actually invited?</b>

03:22.330 --> 03:23.580
<b>Let's do it at mine.</b>

03:23.580 --> 03:24.540
<b>Okay?</b>

03:25.580 --> 03:28.210
<b>I guess she really DIDN'T actually invite me!</b>

03:28.460 --> 03:30.630
<b>I wanna die...</b>

03:30.630 --> 03:32.920
<b>More than I have for half a decade...</b>

03:32.920 --> 03:35.920
<b>The rest of them are Yamada's friends.</b>

03:35.920 --> 03:39.080
<b>To them I'm just a piece of
trash that's in the same class.</b>

03:39.420 --> 03:41.580
<b>Should have realized that from the start.</b>

03:42.500 --> 03:43.000
<b>Wait...</b>

03:43.420 --> 03:44.790
<b>Hang on, though...</b>

03:44.790 --> 03:45.880
<b>Yesterday she...</b>

03:46.040 --> 03:47.210
<b>2 PM tomorrow</b>

03:46.790 --> 03:49.000
<b>Maybe this was a mis-text?</b>

03:47.880 --> 03:48.830
<b>Ok</b>

03:47.880 --> 03:48.830
<b>Read</b>

03:49.420 --> 03:50.540
<b>Or it meant something else?</b>

03:50.540 --> 03:51.960
<b>Oh, what's up?</b>

03:53.790 --> 03:54.830
<b>Nothing, I...</b>

03:54.830 --> 03:56.080
<b>This is the place.</b>

03:56.580 --> 03:57.710
<b>C'mon, we're going in!</b>

03:57.710 --> 03:59.080
<b>Wha? Wait...
</b><b>C'mon, we're going in!</b><b></b>

04:04.710 --> 04:06.630
<b>I have no idea what's going on...</b>

04:07.130 --> 04:09.580
<b>Me and him are friends, see.</b>

04:10.420 --> 04:13.130
<b>Are we...?</b>

04:13.960 --> 04:15.790
<b>Finally!</b>

04:15.920 --> 04:18.710
<b>Hey, hang on.
You eating our ingredients?</b>

04:18.710 --> 04:21.630
<b>N-no! This is something else!</b>

04:21.630 --> 04:23.380
<b>You sure are dressed up.</b>

04:23.380 --> 04:24.540
<b>You think?</b>

04:24.540 --> 04:25.880
<b>Come on in.</b>

04:28.290 --> 04:31.880
<b>Careful now, her mom's super strict.</b>

04:31.880 --> 04:34.630
<b>Oh, no, I... Yeah, huh?</b>

04:35.170 --> 04:36.500
<b>Come on in!</b>

04:36.750 --> 04:38.540
<b>Thanks for having us.</b>

04:41.830 --> 04:43.290
<b>A boy?</b>

04:45.580 --> 04:48.420
<b>So, how exactly do you know my daughter?</b>

04:49.960 --> 04:51.920
<b>Do I say we're friends?</b>

04:51.920 --> 04:55.080
<b>Are we? What even is a friend?</b>

04:55.330 --> 04:58.830
<b>Oh, he's like, my bae.</b>

04:59.040 --> 04:59.880
<b>What...?</b>

05:01.670 --> 05:04.960
<b>Oh, really? You kids these days...</b>

05:04.960 --> 05:06.040
<b>Come in.</b>

05:07.000 --> 05:08.380
<b>What choice did I have?</b>

05:08.380 --> 05:11.670
<b>R-really?! Is that why you brought him?!</b>

05:11.670 --> 05:13.210
<b>BayashiKo...!</b>

05:14.130 --> 05:16.170
<b>Why not have your dad teach you?</b>

05:15.130 --> 05:16.170
<b>Baking Paper</b>

05:16.330 --> 05:18.920
<b>He says it's too dangerous to teach me.</b>

05:18.920 --> 05:20.580
<b>Yeah, might have a point...</b>

05:20.580 --> 05:23.380
<b>I still feel like I shouldn't have come...</b>

05:25.290 --> 05:26.250
<b>I'll get the button.</b>

05:27.960 --> 05:29.130
<b>Oh my...</b>

05:30.830 --> 05:32.210
<b>I'll get it!</b>

05:32.500 --> 05:34.380
<b>Oh, you...</b>

05:35.790 --> 05:37.210
<b>My my...</b>

05:37.460 --> 05:39.790
<b>Can't you do this by yourself?
</b><b>All of this is bad.</b><b></b>

05:39.790 --> 05:41.540
<b>None of this can be good.</b>

05:41.540 --> 05:42.630
<b>Okay, all set!</b>

05:43.920 --> 05:48.580
<b>All right then, Ich-I mean Kyotaro...</b>

05:48.580 --> 05:49.880
<b>Pass that over.</b>

05:50.500 --> 05:51.250
<b>This?</b>

05:51.250 --> 05:52.750
<b>No, that!</b>

05:53.040 --> 05:55.830
<b>The two of you are classmates, right?</b>

05:55.830 --> 05:56.710
<b>When did you start...?</b>

05:56.710 --> 05:57.830
<b>Enough!</b>

05:57.830 --> 05:59.330
<b>Just leave us be.</b>

05:59.330 --> 06:01.460
<b>Are you kids all right on your own?</b>

06:01.710 --> 06:04.790
<b>So? What are you thinking of for White Day?</b>

06:05.500 --> 06:08.250
<b>You better start thinking.</b>

06:08.250 --> 06:10.040
<b>Huh? What's that supposed to mean?</b>

06:10.040 --> 06:12.210
<b>Nothing for you to worry about, BayashiKo.</b>

06:12.210 --> 06:14.080
<b>In fact, don't even bother thinking about it.</b>

06:14.710 --> 06:18.460
<b>Sheesh, everyone's growing up, huh?</b>

06:18.460 --> 06:21.170
<b>Only kids left are me and Yamada.</b>

06:23.500 --> 06:24.670
<b>Hey, though...</b>

06:24.670 --> 06:27.330
<b>Anna loves all sorts of food and all,</b>

06:27.330 --> 06:29.130
<b>but what does she like most?</b>

06:29.130 --> 06:30.880
<b>Even I can't answer that.</b>

06:31.290 --> 06:37.080
<b>I mean, ever since we first met in junior high,
I never really got her.</b>

06:37.080 --> 06:39.420
<b>I'm Anna Yamada from class 1-1.</b>

06:39.830 --> 06:45.580
<b>My first impression was she was huge,
miles away, and never made any sense.</b>

06:45.920 --> 06:49.130
<b>Like, when I thought she hung back for extra practice...</b>

06:51.290 --> 06:54.130
<b>One... Two... Ah!</b>

06:54.790 --> 06:57.630
<b>Is she seriously practicing spinning the ball?</b>

06:59.500 --> 07:00.670
<b>She's crying!</b>

07:00.920 --> 07:02.630
<b>Just eight seconds to go.</b>

07:02.630 --> 07:04.210
<b>You weren't even close!</b>

07:04.960 --> 07:07.130
<b>That's just what she was like.</b>

07:07.130 --> 07:09.710
<b>That's got nothing to do with what food she likes!</b>

07:09.710 --> 07:12.630
<b>Yeah, well, I guess what she really likes...</b>

07:12.630 --> 07:14.790
<b>...is me, I'd say.</b>

07:16.630 --> 07:18.630
<b>Serina, can you pass me that?</b>

07:18.630 --> 07:19.920
<b>Yeah, here.</b>

07:19.920 --> 07:21.920
<b>Listen, though!</b>

07:22.210 --> 07:25.750
<b>You should have heard her afterwards.</b>

07:26.330 --> 07:28.460
<b>The sports festival in elementary school?</b>

07:28.460 --> 07:32.170
<b>Yeah, you got the most points, right?</b>

07:32.170 --> 07:33.920
<b>And like, you're smaller than...</b>

07:34.250 --> 07:36.330
<b>Sorry... But still...</b>

07:36.330 --> 07:37.170
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

07:37.670 --> 07:42.080
<b>I can't believe you still practice everyday
even though you're already that good!</b>

07:42.710 --> 07:46.080
<b>She told me she looked up to me,
and I was so awesome and cool.</b>

07:46.080 --> 07:48.630
<b>Doubt she went that far.</b>

07:48.630 --> 07:52.580
<b>Despite what you might think,
she's pretty mindful of folks around her.</b>

07:52.960 --> 07:55.920
<b>Think, though... What does she like?</b>

07:56.540 --> 07:58.250
<b>Gah, what am I thinking?</b>

07:58.250 --> 08:03.630
<b>The fact she even invited me here might
mean she doesn't think of me that way...</b>

08:03.960 --> 08:06.420
<b>I'm just not sure I can leave you kids to it alone.</b>

08:06.420 --> 08:07.670
<b>Ugh...</b>

08:08.000 --> 08:10.790
<b>Sit here and be quiet, then.</b>

08:10.790 --> 08:12.130
<b>Fine, fine.</b>

08:14.830 --> 08:17.670
<b>Icchi, we should brainstorm what ways we take this.</b>

08:18.540 --> 08:20.290
<b>What's that supposed to mean?</b>

08:20.540 --> 08:23.130
<b>Let's start with you calling me Moeko.</b>

08:23.130 --> 08:24.210
<b>What? No...</b>

08:24.210 --> 08:26.210
<b>Oh, come on.</b>

08:26.210 --> 08:28.130
<b>C'mon, give it a try!</b>

08:28.130 --> 08:29.670
<b>M-Moeko...</b>

08:29.670 --> 08:31.080
<b>You're so bad at this!</b>

08:32.290 --> 08:35.130
<b>This just isn't right!</b>

08:38.630 --> 08:40.500
<b>Now what?</b>

08:40.500 --> 08:43.290
<b>No need to just yell like that.</b>

08:43.290 --> 08:45.580
<b>Pass me that, I'm gonna start shaking it on.</b>

08:47.750 --> 08:49.130
<b>What's with you?</b>

08:52.500 --> 08:55.080
<b>These are clearly some bad vibes.</b>

08:57.580 --> 09:00.330
<b>Must be 'cause I'm here.</b>

09:00.670 --> 09:01.580
<b>Having fun?</b>

09:01.580 --> 09:03.540
<b>Huh? I guess...</b>

09:03.540 --> 09:04.080
<b>Hmm?</b>

09:07.250 --> 09:08.580
<b>Having fun...?</b>

09:11.380 --> 09:14.040
<b>I-I'm just gonna use the bathroom...</b>

09:20.000 --> 09:21.710
<b>Okay, I'm leaving.</b>

09:21.710 --> 09:23.080
<b>No, you aren't.</b>

09:23.830 --> 09:27.790
<b>First things first,
Yamada's mom needs to know this isn't true.</b>

09:28.040 --> 09:29.920
<b>Otherwise nothing good is going to come of this.</b>

09:29.920 --> 09:31.080
<b>When?</b>

09:31.380 --> 09:34.920
<b>Let's say by some miracle
you and Yamada start dating.</b>

09:35.250 --> 09:37.670
<b>What are you going to say when
she introduces you to her parents?</b>

09:38.040 --> 09:40.750
<b>That you broke up with Sekine to get with Yamada?</b>

09:41.500 --> 09:44.500
<b>That would never happen,
so it doesn't matter.</b>

09:44.500 --> 09:46.330
<b>Are you really fine with that?</b>

09:47.830 --> 09:49.380
<b>Get off my back!</b>

09:49.380 --> 09:51.460
<b>I'm the one who'll wind up hurt if
I start getting my hopes up.</b>

09:51.710 --> 09:53.040
<b>Guess that's true.</b>

10:02.790 --> 10:05.670
<b>Oh, are you leaving?</b>

10:05.670 --> 10:07.130
<b>Thanks for having me...</b>

10:10.130 --> 10:13.290
<b>Miracles aren't real.</b>

10:14.080 --> 10:17.420
<b>There was never any chance.</b>

10:18.880 --> 10:19.790
<b>But...</b>

10:21.920 --> 10:24.630
<b>The thing about me and Sekine dating wasn't true.</b>

10:24.630 --> 10:26.920
<b>Sorry for lying. My apologies...</b>

10:31.830 --> 10:35.250
<b>Even still, I want to believe.</b>

10:35.960 --> 10:38.380
<b>In miracles. In myself.</b>

10:43.210 --> 10:46.040
<b>Is your name Ichikawa, by any chance?</b>

10:46.040 --> 10:47.210
<b>Huh? Yes...</b>

10:47.210 --> 10:48.210
<b>I knew it.</b>

10:48.790 --> 10:53.500
<b>I spoke with your mother before
the parent teacher conferences.</b>

10:53.500 --> 10:55.420
<b>Anna says the two of you always talk.</b>

10:55.420 --> 10:58.130
<b>A little while back she even told me she-</b>

10:58.380 --> 11:00.630
<b>Mom! Get back inside!</b>

11:03.170 --> 11:04.210
<b>Later, then.</b>

11:06.830 --> 11:08.170
<b>Stick around.</b>

11:10.670 --> 11:11.750
<b>Fine...</b>

11:15.210 --> 11:18.420
<b>Why didn't you deny it as soon as Moeko lied?</b>

11:18.420 --> 11:23.290
<b>I mean, if I did then she'd ask what I was doing here.</b>

11:24.080 --> 11:27.040
<b>I'd force you into lying to her again.</b>

11:28.540 --> 11:33.630
<b>I thought I should be the real
me in front of her, this time.</b>

11:35.330 --> 11:37.420
<b>Ugh. I sound like such a creep.</b>

11:38.290 --> 11:39.250
<b>Let's head back in.</b>

11:41.580 --> 11:46.920
<b>I didn't think I still had it in
me to think I have a chance.</b>

11:48.960 --> 11:49.580
<b>Huh?</b>

11:54.880 --> 11:56.130
<b>No...</b>

11:56.710 --> 11:58.210
<b>This won't do.</b>

12:01.250 --> 12:02.880
<b>Won't do at all...</b>

12:04.130 --> 12:06.210
<b>What is this thing?!</b>

12:14.580 --> 12:15.960
<b>This is all too soon.</b>

12:16.420 --> 12:17.670
<b>That's her dad, right?</b>

12:17.670 --> 12:19.080
<b>I can't read his expression.</b>

12:19.830 --> 12:22.790
<b>But I can tell he's not happy I'm here.</b>

12:30.040 --> 12:31.210
<b>What was that?!</b>

12:31.210 --> 12:32.460
<b>He came outta nowhere!</b>

12:32.460 --> 12:34.710
<b>Should we have said something?</b>

12:34.960 --> 12:36.170
<b>Moeko...</b>

12:36.170 --> 12:36.710
<b>Huh?</b>

12:36.710 --> 12:39.080
<b>Thanks. And sorry.</b>

12:39.500 --> 12:42.250
<b>You were quick to help me, but I...</b>

12:42.250 --> 12:44.250
<b>We're way beyond that phase!</b>

12:44.500 --> 12:45.830
<b>Was that your dad?</b>

12:45.830 --> 12:49.080
<b>Yeah, he's a chef. He cooks French food.</b>

12:49.880 --> 12:52.710
<b>He's so tall! Like a giant!</b>

12:52.960 --> 12:54.130
<b>A giant...?</b>

12:55.170 --> 12:59.130
<b>Hang on, that's the guy I saw in the elevator...</b>

13:00.250 --> 13:03.290
<b>There's no way he remembers me, right?</b>

13:03.830 --> 13:05.540
<b>I should be fine...</b>

13:11.250 --> 13:12.420
<b>What's wrong?</b>

13:12.630 --> 13:14.880
<b>I shouldn't keep this to myself.</b>

13:15.130 --> 13:16.210
<b>Well, actually...</b>

13:25.080 --> 13:27.500
<b>I'm done with lies. Time for the truth...</b>

13:27.500 --> 13:30.330
<b>You play games?</b>

13:30.920 --> 13:31.790
<b>Huh?</b>

13:32.580 --> 13:34.540
<b>I guess so...</b>

13:36.040 --> 13:36.920
<b>What?</b>

13:37.580 --> 13:40.380
<b>W-what is going on?</b>

13:43.460 --> 13:45.330
<b>You pick first.</b>

13:46.040 --> 13:49.460
<b>Sorry, he has no sense of personal space.</b>

13:49.460 --> 13:50.420
<b>What...?</b>

13:50.710 --> 13:54.170
<b>No one else here plays games.</b>

13:54.170 --> 13:55.290
<b>What?</b>

13:56.580 --> 13:58.500
<b>I play too.</b>

13:59.080 --> 14:01.460
<b>Bow down before me!</b>

14:01.460 --> 14:03.000
<b>Bring it on!</b>

14:03.420 --> 14:04.710
<b>Ready? Round one!</b>

14:06.290 --> 14:08.330
<b>W-what is going on?</b>

14:08.750 --> 14:09.540
<b>Bwha?!</b>

14:16.420 --> 14:18.630
<b>You rocking some crazy pheromones or something?</b>

14:18.630 --> 14:21.040
<b>No, he's just a gamer.</b>

14:21.380 --> 14:24.500
<b>Doesn't really look like Anna though, does he?</b>

14:24.500 --> 14:28.290
<b>You'd think a chef in a high-rise like this'd be more-</b>

14:28.290 --> 14:29.130
<b>Huh?</b>

14:31.250 --> 14:33.330
<b>No way!</b>

14:34.080 --> 14:34.880
<b>Obligatory</b>

14:35.040 --> 14:36.830
<b>There! All done!</b>

14:37.880 --> 14:41.000
<b>Can we ask Mr. Yamada to try them for us?</b>

14:41.000 --> 14:41.750
<b>Sure.</b>

14:42.080 --> 14:44.170
<b>He should be in the other room.</b>

14:44.170 --> 14:46.420
<b>He helped us out and all.</b>

14:46.420 --> 14:47.750
<b>Did he, now?</b>

14:54.670 --> 14:57.210
<b>Here. This is for you.</b>

14:57.210 --> 14:58.000
<b>Huh?</b>

14:58.000 --> 14:59.750
<b>Obli-</b>

14:58.420 --> 14:59.750
<b>Just to taste, right?</b>

14:59.750 --> 15:02.630
<b>Yeah. So go on, then.</b>

15:15.330 --> 15:16.000
<b>How is it?</b>

15:17.830 --> 15:19.500
<b>Too sweet, maybe.</b>

15:19.500 --> 15:20.540
<b>Oh...</b>

15:20.540 --> 15:23.130
<b>I mean, that's just my personal opinion, though.</b>

15:28.710 --> 15:31.290
<b>This is why I'm glad you came.</b>

15:37.460 --> 15:38.880
<b>I'm exhausted...</b>

15:38.880 --> 15:40.790
<b>Even more than last time.</b>

15:42.210 --> 15:46.250
<b>Ichikawa, you've been over there before, haven't you?</b>

15:47.540 --> 15:49.500
<b>I mean, you knew where the bathroom was.</b>

15:49.960 --> 15:52.710
<b>And hit the elevator button as soon as we got in.</b>

15:53.000 --> 15:55.130
<b>Wha?! Did you two really do it?!</b>

15:55.130 --> 15:57.540
<b>No! I just stopped by real quick.</b>

15:58.000 --> 15:59.630
<b>But you HAVE been over!</b>

16:00.210 --> 16:02.210
<b>Sheesh. Well?</b>

16:02.210 --> 16:04.830
<b>If you knew all that, why'd you have to yell?</b>

16:04.830 --> 16:06.210
<b>You scared me!</b>

16:06.210 --> 16:09.330
<b>I get that you were trynna help,</b>

16:09.330 --> 16:11.790
<b>but you were clearly having fun with it.</b>

16:12.170 --> 16:14.000
<b>W-who, me?</b>

16:14.330 --> 16:16.420
<b>Girls are scary!</b>

16:16.420 --> 16:19.290
<b>Yamada seemed upset that...</b>

16:20.920 --> 16:22.290
<b>Nah, nevermind.</b>

16:25.290 --> 16:27.080
<b>Thanks for everything, today.</b>

16:27.080 --> 16:28.670
<b>Don't mention it.</b>

16:31.670 --> 16:33.710
<b>I'm still headed this way, though...</b>

16:34.250 --> 16:35.790
<b>Then why'd you stop?</b>

16:36.170 --> 16:37.500
<b>Don't get smart with us.</b>

16:37.500 --> 16:38.210
<b>Huh?</b>

16:38.210 --> 16:40.170
<b>If you do it, say so. You're in for it otherwise!</b>

16:40.170 --> 16:41.290
<b>Not gonna happen!</b>

16:41.290 --> 16:43.000
<b>Aren't we friends?</b>

16:43.710 --> 16:46.460
<b>What?! You fixed up chocolates at Anna's house?!</b>

16:46.960 --> 16:48.250
<b>W-with everyone else, yeah.</b>

16:48.250 --> 16:49.500
<b>Who else?</b>

16:49.500 --> 16:51.250
<b>Yamada's friends.</b>

16:51.630 --> 16:52.880
<b>All girls?</b>

16:52.880 --> 16:53.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:54.040 --> 16:56.630
<b>You're already building up a harem? C'mon!</b>

16:56.830 --> 16:58.790
<b>What do you mean "already"?!</b>

16:59.130 --> 16:59.830
<b>Anna Yamada</b>

17:02.830 --> 17:05.380
<b>Someone's sure busier than ever.</b>

17:05.830 --> 17:07.000
<b>What is it?</b>

17:08.000 --> 17:10.710
<b>Was just wondering what you thought of today.</b>

17:10.710 --> 17:12.210
<b>About my mom and dad.</b>

17:12.790 --> 17:15.170
<b>They both look really strict.</b>

17:15.170 --> 17:17.210
<b>I was honestly pretty scared.</b>

17:17.210 --> 17:20.460
<b>But once I started being straight with
them they were nice, and mature, and...</b>

17:20.960 --> 17:25.130
<b>I guess, they were just like what
I'd expect your parents to be like.</b>

17:25.130 --> 17:28.080
<b>Know what? They said basically the same thing.</b>

17:28.080 --> 17:28.710
<b>Huh?</b>

17:29.380 --> 17:31.540
<b>Hey hey! How was it today?</b>

17:31.540 --> 17:32.540
<b>Packed.</b>

17:32.540 --> 17:35.630
<b>Not at work! I mean my friends!</b>

17:36.380 --> 17:38.670
<b>There was a boy...</b>

17:40.710 --> 17:43.040
<b>Forgot to ask for his friend code.</b>

17:43.670 --> 17:45.710
<b>Hope he comes back.</b>

17:46.040 --> 17:47.170
<b>Really?!</b>

17:49.380 --> 17:50.630
<b>How about you?</b>

17:50.630 --> 17:51.750
<b>Well...</b>

17:52.170 --> 17:55.130
<b>I guess they were like what I'd expect.</b>

17:56.040 --> 17:57.210
<b>What do you think that means?</b>

17:57.210 --> 17:58.170
<b>Beats me.</b>

17:58.170 --> 18:00.040
<b>Stop asking about me, anyway.</b>

18:00.040 --> 18:01.000
<b>Why?</b>

18:01.000 --> 18:02.670
<b>Because I'm a thing of the shadows.</b>

18:02.670 --> 18:04.670
<b>Get this about my dad, though.</b>

18:04.670 --> 18:07.210
<b>He was calling you "Yamada" for some reason.</b>

18:07.210 --> 18:09.210
<b>Told me to ask for "Yamada's friend code."</b>

18:09.210 --> 18:10.330
<b>What...?</b>

18:11.750 --> 18:12.960
<b>YAMADA</b>

18:15.580 --> 18:17.330
<b>Come over again sometime, okay?</b>

18:17.330 --> 18:22.210
<b>Y-yeah, maybe a little while from now.</b>

18:22.500 --> 18:25.330
<b>Yeah? See you tomorrow, then.</b>

18:25.330 --> 18:26.330
<b>Good night!</b>

18:26.330 --> 18:28.210
<b>Yeah, g'night.</b>

18:29.670 --> 18:31.460
<b>Hey, how'd it go?</b>

18:32.170 --> 18:34.210
<b>What are you drinking?</b>

18:34.210 --> 18:35.790
<b>Big sis is all grown up!</b>

18:35.790 --> 18:38.000
<b>Oh, hey, want some amazake?</b>

18:36.880 --> 18:41.040
<b>Triple Lemon</b>

18:36.880 --> 18:41.040
<b>Soft Dried Squid</b>

18:36.880 --> 18:41.040
<b>Alcohol</b>

18:38.000 --> 18:38.670
<b>No thanks.</b>

18:38.670 --> 18:40.830
<b>Don't be like that.</b>

18:41.130 --> 18:42.540
<b>Cheers!</b>

18:41.580 --> 18:42.170
<b>Extra lemony!</b>

18:42.170 --> 18:42.790
<b>Extra lemony!</b>

18:42.170 --> 18:42.790
<b>Delicious</b>

18:42.170 --> 18:42.790
<b>Amazake</b>

18:42.170 --> 18:42.790
<b>Made in Hokkaido</b>

18:50.040 --> 18:51.290
<b>So like...</b>

18:51.920 --> 18:52.880
<b>...are you gonna ask her out?</b>

18:54.880 --> 18:56.710
<b>What a stereotypical reaction!</b>

18:56.710 --> 18:59.330
<b>Sorry! It was the drink talking!</b>

18:59.330 --> 19:01.830
<b>But I figure you could.</b>

19:01.830 --> 19:03.330
<b>Gimme a break.</b>

19:03.960 --> 19:05.460
<b>I don't have the confidence.</b>

19:06.290 --> 19:09.420
<b>I have no idea how she feels or what my chances are.</b>

19:09.960 --> 19:11.170
<b>No, huh?</b>

19:11.170 --> 19:14.500
<b>I'm not gonna try and force you or anything.</b>

19:14.500 --> 19:18.380
<b>You're still in junior high. I figure you can take it slow.</b>

19:19.380 --> 19:19.920
<b>But...</b>

19:19.920 --> 19:20.540
<b>Huh?</b>

19:20.540 --> 19:24.000
<b>You could also say since you're only in junior high,</b>

19:20.540 --> 19:28.500
<b>Beginner's Chocolate Making</b>

19:24.000 --> 19:26.330
<b>you're gonna grow and find lots of</b>

19:26.330 --> 19:28.540
<b>things you like and have fun with,</b>

19:28.540 --> 19:30.130
<b>and things around you will change.</b>

19:30.670 --> 19:32.540
<b>Even your feelings will change.</b>

19:34.420 --> 19:36.500
<b>Goes for you as much as anyone.</b>

19:36.500 --> 19:40.460
<b>I mean, do you know how many
billions of women there are in the world?</b>

19:40.460 --> 19:42.420
<b>There's no telling when you'll have a change of heart.</b>

19:42.420 --> 19:43.380
<b>I won't!</b>

19:44.670 --> 19:47.960
<b>I think I'll always like Yamada.</b>

19:48.750 --> 19:52.080
<b>If nothing else, I'm sure of that.</b>

19:52.750 --> 19:54.290
<b>Not that I have any ground to say so.</b>

19:56.830 --> 20:02.540
<b>But, Yamada lives in a bigger world than me.</b>

20:03.380 --> 20:05.790
<b>She's going to make mistakes but keep moving ahead.</b>

20:05.790 --> 20:09.790
<b>Loving and being loved by so many people.</b>

20:11.040 --> 20:14.830
<b>If she suddenly had to go far away tomorrow,</b>

20:14.830 --> 20:17.580
<b>I'm sure she'd forget about me in no time.</b>

20:18.750 --> 20:20.250
<b>I mean, I wouldn't...</b>

20:20.250 --> 20:22.960
<b>And I don't want her to!</b>

20:22.960 --> 20:24.630
<b>K... Kyo-chan?</b>

20:27.670 --> 20:32.080
<b>You know, it's never really about
"having a chance" and all that.</b>

20:32.080 --> 20:33.790
<b>It's all about what you wanna do.</b>

20:33.790 --> 20:35.500
<b>It all starts from there!</b>

20:36.000 --> 20:36.960
<b>I...</b>

20:36.960 --> 20:37.750
<b>Huh?</b>

20:40.500 --> 20:41.540
<b>I...</b>

20:42.080 --> 20:43.580
<b>Yamada...</b>

20:44.170 --> 20:45.630
<b>...want to be...</b>

20:46.080 --> 20:47.500
<b>...and Me</b>

20:48.750 --> 20:50.080
<b>...her boyfriend.</b>

20:57.500 --> 20:59.630
<b>How are you drunk on amazake?</b>

20:59.630 --> 21:02.080
<b>Tell me that didn't have any alcohol in it!</b>

21:02.080 --> 21:03.540
<b>I don't even care!</b>

21:04.630 --> 21:05.670
<b>In the end...</b>

21:05.670 --> 21:09.130
<b>Never figured out what chocolate
to give the guys in the end.</b>

21:09.830 --> 21:12.250
<b>...there's no guarantee we have a tomorrow together.</b>

21:13.080 --> 21:14.250
<b>And if there isn't...</b>

21:14.960 --> 21:16.380
<b>...then maybe I should...</b>

21:17.080 --> 21:18.540
<b>Maybe I can...</b>

21:20.540 --> 21:21.920
<b>Why don't you just not?</b>

21:26.960 --> 21:27.710
<b>Okay!</b>

21:29.290 --> 21:31.290
<b>...try for what I want a little.</b>

21:31.670 --> 21:33.880
<b>Yamada and Me</b>
